<title>FRANCE: Algeria and Germany boost economic cooperation.</title>
<headline>Algeria and Germany boost economic cooperation.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian and German businessmen have signed five accords to set up joint ventures in the North African country in manufacturing, trade and service sectors, the official Algerian news agency APS said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deals, signed on Tuesday, confirmed improved bilateral cooperation which had seen a German state export body increase loans to $700 million this year from a previous level of $200 million, APS said.</p>
</text>
